# Bandit Level 4 → Level 5

## Level Goal
Find the only human-readable file among 10 files in the `inhere` directory.

## Commands Used
cd inhere
ls -la
file ./*
cat "./-file07"

## What I Learned
- The `file` command identifies what type of data a file contains
- `*` is a wildcard that runs the command against all files at once
- "ASCII text" means human-readable — all others showed as raw `data`
